On .NET 10, **you no longer need `TestingPlatformDotnetTestSupport`**. That property was the .NET 9 bridge. Instead, .NET 10 has native MTP mode — you just add a `"test"` section to `global.json`:

```json
{
  "sdk": { "version": "10.0.100" },
  "test": { "runner": "Microsoft.Testing.Platform" }
}
```

Then remove `TestingPlatformDotnetTestSupport` from your csproj.

